<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA GAS 1996 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA GAS 1996 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian Gas' 1996 net profit fell to 3.93 million litas from 43.53 million litas the year before, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The company, quoted in the A list of the stock exchange, said that its 1996 sales were 729.20 million litas versus 712.64 million litas.  </p>
<p>In a statement of unaudited results, Lithuanian Gas said that its gross profit was 43.34 million litas and that operating expenses were 46.16 million litas.</p>
<p>This led to an operating loss of 2.8 million litas and it had an extraordinary loss of 15.7 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Vilnius Newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
